# Fraudebot

Fraudebot lets people search reports other users have filed, so they can check a person or company before sending money. Search covers card numbers, Mexican CLABE, bank accounts, and crypto wallets. Search is free.

# Objectives

- **Report form**: Users submit a report about a scammer or an organization. Details are in `reports.mdc`.
- **Scammer and organization pages**: Users open a profile that other people have already reported.
- **WhatsApp bot**: Upcoming. Users will search the same data from WhatsApp.

# Git / GitHub

When the user asks to commit, push, or open a pull request, follow `.cursor/rules/pushing-changes-to-github.mdc` exactly (emoji titles, Co-Authored-By, `git push -u origin HEAD`, `gh pr create --fill` only unless they ask otherwise).

Agent workflows: `/commit` (logical multi-commit + push, `.cursor/agents/commit.md`) then `/publish` (GitHub PR, default base `main`, `.cursor/agents/create-pr.md`).
